# 统一换行符：仓库内与检出时都使用 LF，避免 Windows/macOS 协作时产生无意义的整文件 diff
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制资源（不做任何换行符转换）
*.png  binary
*.ico  binary
*.icns binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf  binary
*.eot  binary

# 锁文件：体积大、非人工编辑，在 diff / linguist 统计中折叠
pnpm-lock.yaml     linguist-generated
Cargo.lock         linguist-generated
